1os9|n|The act of redressing; a making right; reformation; correction; amendment. ; A setting right, as of wrong, injury, or opression; as, the redress of grievances; hence, relief; remedy; reparation; indemnification. ; One who, or that which, gives relief; a redresser.	v:1t6q,102,6~1t6q,102,6	n:1t6q,76,1~1t6q,76,1
