1p13|n|To generate or produce anew; to reproduce; to give new life, strength, or vigor to. ; To cause to be spiritually born anew; to cause to become a Christian; to convert from sin to holiness; to implant holy affections in the heart of. ; Hence, to make a radical change for the better in the character or condition of; as, to regenerate society.	V:1a51,27,4~1a51,27,4	N:1bre,80,1~1bre,80,1
